// Title: MSI Installation From Suspicious Locations
// ID: c7c8aa1c-5aff-408e-828b-998e3620b341
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-08-31
// Tags: attack.execution
// Description: Detects MSI package installation from suspicious locations
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((Provider_Name EQ "MsiInstaller" AND (EventID EQ "1040" OR EventID EQ "1042") AND (Data CONTAINS ":\\Windows\\TEMP\\" OR Data CONTAINS "\\\\\\\\" OR Data CONTAINS "\\Desktop\\" OR Data CONTAINS "\\PerfLogs\\" OR Data CONTAINS "\\Users\\Public\\")) AND NOT (((Data CONTAINS "C:\\Windows\\TEMP\\UpdHealthTools.msi") OR (Data CONTAINS "\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\WinGet\\"))))
